{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2cb5639ecd72c7216c3660d61859370f7769e0c67bc4e74e095d9abd227c6f16", "ja": "（『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』のメンバーと子ども達が\n約束していた、再会の劇場公演が無事終了した……！）", "zh": "（《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的成员与孩子们约好的\n重逢剧场公演平安落幕了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "da5f9a48a745126ca07fbc70ac14535919e082644a24e00ba0bcb51b297bc9a1", "ja": "（子ども達の家族も招いてのステージは、今までにない\n雰囲気に包まれた。こういうのも、いいもんだな……）", "zh": "（这次也邀了孩子们的家人一起前来观赏，表演中充满\n前所未有的气氛，这样也很不错呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "07d87cd70e1132c277c8251156d868e3d7605a0ddff4c0561ced7185ceff7b18", "ja": "はぁ……。\n……あ、{$P$}……！", "zh": "唉……\n……啊，{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "56c50202f0af5203f6fca692dd3e17ac9d945dc081d89a436b96ef9f12797a4f", "ja": "子ども達を招待してくれて、本当にありがとうねぇ。\nみんなとまた会えて、なまらうれしかったよぉ。", "zh": "太谢谢你邀请小朋友们来了。\n能再次见到大家，我特开心喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "63352060d7d32536855b1e8bf9669bf790f38c94c07576858f12fe95f817321c", "ja": "{$P$}も疲れたんでないかい？\nおいしいお漬物があるから、控え室でお茶にするべさ。", "zh": "{$P$}是不是也累了？\n我有很好吃的腌渍物，请在准备室喝杯茶哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d936a540b485c31cb81758b22698093bd008389356d1b064d75b38be26fce745", "ja": "ありがたいけど、ひなたも疲れてるんじゃないか？\nさっき溜息をついてたみたいだし……。", "zh": "谢谢你的好意，但你也累了吧？\n刚才好像听你叹气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "5159e20ecd7b97b67499cea6fb99283a2c739cd1c9dcc49c60bbaf3d38d89f6a", "ja": "ありゃ～、見てたのかい？　ごめんねぇ。\nでも、さっきのは疲れてたんじゃなくて……。", "zh": "哎呀～你看见了吗？对不起呢～\n但我刚才并不是累得叹气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "d3c111bcba643cf666ad0444de2ceb807a4e4ef0a0a3b38c5fa1e99677406bf7", "ja": "ちょっこし、実家にいる弟のことを\n思い出してたんだわ。", "zh": "只是稍微想起了在老家的弟弟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e5c6172d425220931c4b5d899a4c0d50d768b2ebe9582085ed20054efac385d1", "ja": "そうか、弟さんを……。\nあれ、そんなに小さい子だったっけ？", "zh": "原来是想起你弟弟……\n咦？他的年纪有那么小吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "c90c842972b7d4dadc1854f63c39939c3966ae4647624dd28ffd56a9560d92dd", "ja": "ううん、もう4年生だよぉ。でも、ちっちゃい頃から\nず～っと一緒だったからねぇ。", "zh": "没有，他已经在念四年级了喔～但是，\n我们从很小的时候就一～直待在一起呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "8b8af043189137382dfe3d07d1d58afb1befa759a178ad925f467047ef705949", "ja": "あの子たちと一緒にいると、ときどき、\n弟のことを思い出すんだぁ。", "zh": "跟那些小朋友待在一起，\n偶尔会让我想起弟弟哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3d7be626298ad8f5c145b1d0a7c7fc9abc18258c7606e1eddfe0ed1c21304b6e", "ja": "そうか……。\nじゃあ、ちょっと寂しくなっちゃったのかな？", "zh": "这样啊……\n那你会不会觉得有点寂寞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6d704e58066661fc4dde7f41f5f80da8449d83139dc46053f9d80228ad5d910", "ja": "ん……。でもね、寂しい気持ちより、\nうれしいって気持ちのほうが大きかったんだよぉ。", "zh": "嗯……不过呀，\n我觉得高兴更胜于寂寞喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0737586f444144284f3985292e6c83a0ec06af234614c05dc0728f5db8b9a45b", "ja": "うれしい……？", "zh": "高兴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "650ada89879cc210540977ebc44ca6225d7bd2b975c876956dbb40f4993162f3", "ja": "うん！　今日来てくれた子達はみんな、あたしらの\nステージをみて、喜んでくれたっしょや？", "zh": "嗯！今天过来的小朋友们看了我们的表演，\n不是都很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "34a32cd9ac6e3c190ba6928d75f3a656bc7302f15f9c8b510c66653ce2e92858", "ja": "したっけ、なんだか弟にも、あたしらのステージを\n喜んでもらえた気持ちになってしまってねぇ。", "zh": "所以，总觉得就像是也让弟弟\n充分享受了我们的表演一样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "362d6f513cce34ab56adf5b3d3877730a7509f297a04d026667e6730144d1eea", "ja": "『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』は北海道でも映るから、\nそのせいかもしれないけど……えへへ、おかしいべさ。", "zh": "不过可能是因为《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》也会在\n北海道播放啦……嘿嘿，这想法真好笑哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f3c23fe87b5a695acef3ee39a0a89742111cc2f988c4c6769155ebd07e657a6b", "ja": "……なるほど。でも、別におかしくないと思うよ。\n子ども達にも、すぐに観てもらえただろ？", "zh": "……原来如此，但我不觉得哪里好笑喔。\n你不是说到做到，很快就让小朋友们看了表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8cbd3b4b5b6d682fa92acc0b39e226e0a45a97090026fe82fe4922e61da1ba3d", "ja": "弟さんにも観てもらうチャンスがあると思う。\nひなたはいつでも、ステージで輝くアイドルだからな！", "zh": "一定也会有机会表演给弟弟看的。\n日向可是无论何时都能在舞台上发光发热的偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "f9917940fab0958c1a85fa6e4987f302a14bafa2b2ba215c4d34137e4bb60add", "ja": "……。そうだねぇ。\nずっとステージにいれば、いつでも……。", "zh": "……说得也是呢～\n只要一直站在舞台上，无论何时都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "0da8e53d9a9c44f2c244baeb0663c731049c553f036960bd82336556dd96e5ea", "ja": "{$P$}、あたし、頑張るよぉ。\nみんなに、いつでも観てもらえるように。だから……。", "zh": "{$P$}，我会努力喔～\n努力让大家无论何时都能看见我表演，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0103_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "aee3d57e4479605b649d4bafcc935d640def15e25a054db4322b87f2368162b0", "ja": "これからも、よろしくお願いいたします♪", "zh": "以后也请你多多指教了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
